      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "The Ozone Layer is located in the Stratosphere, protecting Earth from harmful solar UV rays.",
        "Ionosphere (within the Thermosphere) reflects radio waves back to Earth, enabling wireless communication.",
        "The Troposphere thickness varies from 8 km at the poles to 18 km at the equator due to convectional currents.",
        "Normal Lapse Rate: Temperature decreases by 6.5°C per 1,000 meters altitude in the Troposphere."
